  s01: <
    handle: "custom-boof/01"
    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "Bone.land did not pretend to be theater. Its square-hewn oak beams rose into the morning like the ribcage of a sleeping leviathan, every mortise and peg left exposed to the weather, because this hall was the small con..."
