    handle: "custom-bonk/02"
    type: "custom-bonk"
    excerpt: "The egg went onto the frame. A weight slid, a beam settled, and the little brass load-bells under the joists rang one after another down the brace until the weight reached the anchor stone and went quiet in the chalk...."
